# PLUGINS.md is a row-scoped global registry table — one row per plugin — that
# every plugin branch edits. Parallel plugin branches therefore collide there by
# construction. `union` is a git built-in merge driver that keeps BOTH sides'
# lines instead of raising a conflict, which resolves parallel-branch row edits
# cleanly as long as each branch only ever edits its OWN plugin's row.
PLUGINS.md merge=union
